## 1. Project objective

Develop a complete full-stack Notes Management System where users can register, securely log in, and manage their personal notes.

Each user must have access only to their own notes. The application must provide rich-text editing, secure authentication, proper exception handling, structured application logging, automated testing, and code quality analysis.

The application should be responsive, user-friendly, maintainable, and structured according to professional software development practices.

